  (text "Secondary leads are lettered on the sheet: blue 100 V line, white 16 ohm, yellow 8 ohm, orange common." (at 263.336 84.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "437333fa-75f8-524f-9a3a-b1a67df27d75"))
  (text "Feedback is taken from the 16 ohm tap." (at 263.336 88.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "45b25dbd-e367-5eaf-9892-8af4fd7c0a08"))
  (text "Power — universal-primary mains transformer (110/250 V, 50/60 c/s) and a centre-tapped HT winding; each arm rectified by three series silicon diodes; reservoir of three series 32 uF pairs;" (at 21.336 186.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "b91b78af-033b-5eea-b619-b8b51d305316"))
  (text "a 20 H choke to the KT66 screen node, then 8.2 k and 10 k rail droppers. The mains lead carries a 2 A slow-blow fuse and the HT centre tap a 1 A slow-blow; a standby switch sits between" (at 21.336 190.778 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "954d7fb5-8644-57f3-9fbc-c9cd1e78d307"))
  (text "the diode bank and the reservoir. Fuses, switch, mains transformer, heater winding and pilot lamp are omitted here — see netlist.cir." (at 21.336 195.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "2266252c-f000-57a4-8660-bd564c2c603d"))
