  (text "Bias: the 470 k trimmer parallels the 150 k, so winding it changes the series resistance ahead of the diode." (at 181.336 270.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "007c9f2a-02c0-5386-a46e-e158cf2a3e62"))
  (text "Four KT66s in parallel push-pull on a 560 V solid-state rail — the JTM45 front end with its output section doubled. The tremolo valve of the source sheet is omitted, so the numbering skips V2." (at 12.7 277.958 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "ecc8a9e9-b679-5c05-9fdc-c8b65c9737e1"))
  (text "Channel I and channel II are identical apart from the 100 pF bright cap across channel II's volume control; the chassis carries two jacks per channel, each with its own 68 kohm stopper." (at 12.7 282.358 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "d1b14e6e-fca7-52f5-a636-fad76020e7ff"))
